SUMMARY:November Hand Processing Event at Wyck
LOCATION:Wyck Historic House And Garden\, 6026 Germantown Avenue Philadelph
 ia\, PA\, 19144
DESCRIPTION:The PA Flax Project has been hosting hand processing events at 
